@title 3D vents: several small grilles count together as the way out for the proposed fan
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cabinet holds four 60 x 60 mm grilles in the right wall (fixture made by qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py). Each is under half of what the proposed filter fan needs, together they are enough: the card adds the fan alone and does not ask for a grille. The run is finished before the shot.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-four-grilles.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 150
expect_not "Locked while the run goes"
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
expect_not "too small for this flow"
expect_not "A grille of about"
shot 01-four-grilles-card
check_layout
check_blank 01-four-grilles-card
